<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Yasotha's Spices - Pure, homemade, authentic</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Young+Serif&family=Hind+Madurai:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#F6EEDF;--card:#EFE4D0;--ink:#4A1B0C;--muted:#7A4A2A;--rule:#DCC9A6;--btn:#6B2E14;--btn-ink:#FFF6E6;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#1F1410;--ink:#F6E9D2;--muted:#D2B48C;--rule:#4A3324;--btn:#E9C98F;--btn-ink:#3A1D0E}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#1F1410;--ink:#F6E9D2;--muted:#D2B48C;--rule:#4A3324;--btn:#E9C98F;--btn-ink:#3A1D0E}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Hind Madurai",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65}
main{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 16px 56px}
.panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}
.panel img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.logo{padding:8px 8px 0}
h2{font-family:"Young Serif",Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:24px;margin:40px 0 6px}
.sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}
.names{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:20px 0 0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.names li{border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 14px;font-size:15px}
.contact{margin-top:8px}
.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:14px 0}
.row:last-of-type{border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.num{font-size:20px;font-weight:500;flex:1 1 150px}
.btn{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:var(--btn);color:var(--btn-ink);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 18px;font-weight:500;font-size:16px}
.btn.alt{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--muted)}
.btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--muted);outline-offset:2px}
.prices{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:17px}
.prices th,.prices td{padding:12px 8px;text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
.prices th:first-child,.prices td:first-child{text-align:left;padding-left:0}
.prices thead th{border-top:0;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
.prices tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<div class="panel logo"><img alt="Yasotha's Spices logo: a mortar and pestle with leaves. Pure, homemade, authentic." src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"></div>

<h2>Our masalas</h2>
<p class="sub">Homemade spice mixes in 100 g packs.</p>
<div class="panel"><img alt="Five Yasotha's Spices packs: Kulambhu Milagai Thool, Chicken/Mutton Masala, Karimasala, Sambar Masala and Garam Masala" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"></div>
<ul class="names">
<li>Kulambhu milagai thool</li><li>Chicken / mutton masala</li><li>Karimasala</li><li>Sambar masala</li><li>Garam masala</li>
</ul>

<h2>Price list</h2>
<p class="sub">Prices in rupees per 100 g pack.</p>
<table class="prices">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Masala</th><th scope="col">100 g</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Kulambhu milagai thool</td><td>₹84</td></tr>
<tr><td>Chicken / mutton masala</td><td>₹76</td></tr>
<tr><td>Karimasala</td><td>₹84</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sambar masala</td><td>₹71</td></tr>
<tr><td>Garam masala</td><td>₹86</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>Order or ask us anything</h2>
<p class="sub">Call or message us on WhatsApp.</p>
<div class="contact">
<div class="row"><span class="num">6383938676</span><a class="btn" href="tel:+916383938676">Call</a><a class="btn alt" href="https://wa.me/916383938676">WhatsApp</a></div>
<div class="row"><span class="num">9003999923</span><a class="btn" href="tel:+919003999923">Call</a><a class="btn alt" href="https://wa.me/919003999923">WhatsApp</a></div>
</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
